   "source": "## 1. Ranked actions + reason codes\n\n*The queue: what to do first, and why, in words a human trusts.*\n\nBelow are the top 10 ranked actions from the final refresh queue, with reason codes driving each prioritization. These are ordered by `final_refresh_score` (high to low).\n\n| Rank | Suggested Action | Reason Codes | Model Probability |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n" +
